{"version":1,"content":"<p>【忘記續 Domain 出事 😂】江蘇鹽城知名老字號「益林醬油」近日因網域管理疏忽引發熱議。</p><p>該公司旗下醬油瓶身印有宣傳 QR Code，下方標示「掃一掃了解更多」，一名李姓消費者掃碼後，竟直接跳轉至非法色情網站。</p><p>李先生隨即向監管部門舉報，事件曝光後，「益林醬油」反而引發搶購潮。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T10:24:03.619841+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T10:08:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T16:38:13.293343+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T10:18:13.926097+00:00","content_hash":"8b9617359c43eac6f4f4cc3075d596f76f87ae503409385317bf533dd01e7504","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}